# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How a directive is carried out (Compliance): three procedures, and the skill
# that walks them. A procedure is a plan walked one step after another; the
# signing plans are procedures too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
<https://drift-king.org/ah/Procedure>
    a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf p-plan:Plan ;
    rdfs:label "procedure" ;
    rdfs:comment "A plan a person or an agent walks, one step after another, as a skill finds it in the model: one chain, every step saying what to do." .
